  "summary": "Bind the eligible CC-001 candidate, TDD ledger, and moving-anchor regression.",
  "why": "Completion review needs exact candidate coordinates, the final eight-artifact identity, and every required TDD phase before selection. Advancing the authority checkpoint exposed a test that confused the mutable manifest anchor with the semantic CC-000 ACTIVE boundary; the test now resolves that state transition directly."
